WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.386
Read this grid in a spiral, from the outside in.

00:05.386 --> 00:12.007
One way is a second grid that marks every cell you’ve seen.

00:12.007 --> 00:14.700
That’s 12 extra numbers.

00:15.000 --> 00:24.594
You only need four walls: top, bottom, left and right.

00:24.594 --> 00:31.700
Everything between them is still unread.

00:32.000 --> 00:37.187
Walk along one wall, then pull it in.

00:37.187 --> 00:47.700
The next side starts where the last one ended, and the box keeps shrinking.

00:48.000 --> 00:53.850
Every cell is read once, so it’s O(m·n) time.

00:53.850 --> 00:59.700
Four walls are all the extra memory you need.
